{"articleNo":"371958","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=371958&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[수업] 2022학년도 1학기 학부(과) 강의평가(최종) 실시 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.05.30","hit":"31174","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">2022</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">학년도&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><font face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\">1</font></span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">학기 학부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">강의평가를 다음과 같이 실시하오니 학생 여러분의&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">적극적인 참여를 부탁드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">강의평가 기간&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><b style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><font face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\">2022. 6. 2.(</font><font face=\"함초롬바탕\">목</font></span></b></span><b style=\"\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><font face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\">) 09:00 ~ 6. 21.(</font><font face=\"함초롬바탕\">화</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">) 24:00</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">참여방법&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">원스톱서비스&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">학사관리&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">강의평가&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">강의평가서 작성</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 3.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">평가내용&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">기본문항&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">+&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">수업유형별</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">이론</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">실험 실습</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">설계</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">) 1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">개 유형&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">+&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">수업유형별</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">온라인</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)*</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">*&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">온라인 수업으로 운영 중인 강좌에 한하여 평가 시행(대면전환한 수업 제외)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 4.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">수업유형별 적용방안&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">수업유형이 혼재되어 있는 경우 학점이 높은 순</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">,&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">동일학점인 경우 이론</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&gt;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">실험 실습</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&gt;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">설계 순으로 적용</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 5.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">유의사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">본 강의평가 설문에 대한&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt;\">익명성은 철저하게 보장</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">이 되며</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">학생이 평가한 결과는&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">성적부여에 영향을 미치지 않는 성적 확정 이후에 해당 교수에게 열람 됩니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; -</span><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></b></span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 237, 125);\">강의평가 기간</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(250, 237, 125);\">&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(250, 237, 125);\">중에</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(250, 237, 125);\">&nbsp;</span></span><b><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 237, 125);\">평가를 실시하지 않은 학생</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(250, 237, 125);\">은 해당 학기</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(250, 237, 125);\">&nbsp;</span></span><b><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 237, 125);\">성적열람기간에&nbsp;</span></b></span><b><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 237, 125);\">성적을 열람할 수 없습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 237, 125);\">.</span></b></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
